It's not the time to hang around

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Indeed, indeed

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.920
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:43.020 --> 23:45.110
﻿Dance! Dance! Dance!

23:45.400 --> 23:48.280
﻿We're going to participate in a village festival!

23:48.660 --> 23:50.820
﻿There, we met a strange boy named Zabie.

23:51.120 --> 23:54.080
﻿Together with Kennosuke, the two have,a sled ride, a fake sword fight, and a big adventure!

23:54.660 --> 23:55.910
﻿And then they go to a secret place.

23:56.620 --> 23:59.830
﻿But, Zabie seems to have a secret of his own.

24:00.500 --> 24:02.710
﻿What? That's not possible!

24:02.880 --> 24:06.560
A Lie at the Alpine Flower Festival

24:03.500 --> 24:06.420
Tomorrow's Nadja, A Lie at the Alpine Flower Festival.

24:06.880 --> 24:08.800
﻿Now, the Door to Destiny opens!
